  data:
    Id: bear_sen_root
    DisplayName: The Sentinel
    Description: 'Fury comes from being hit: 150 times the blow''s size against his
      maximum health, at least 3 and at most 25 a hit, measured before his defences
      so armour never cuts his income. A blow his planted shield or Shieldwall soaks
      counts. None for swinging. Unlocks Brace, a ward worth a fifth of his health.
      Free, but only one path''s root talent can be active at a time; respec to change
      it.'
